  "description": "<p>This Pride Rainbow Doormat offers a vibrant and welcoming addition to any home. Featuring colorful artwork inspired by inclusivity and positivity, this doormat helps create a warm and inviting atmosphere. It is designed for everyday use and adds personality and warmth to your home decor.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with rainbow artwork.</li>\n<li>Designed for everyday use with a comfortable surface.</li>\n<li>Non-slip backing ensures stability.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Adds a personalized and inclusive touch to home aesthetics.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for use in entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorms, classrooms, offices, and both indoor and outdoor spaces, making it a versatile decorative piece for various settings.</p>",
